done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards."}'::jsonb, 'N/A', '1. Flat 20% off on Full Body Massage(Swedish/Deep Tissue/Indian Abhyanga 60/90 Mins) 2. Use Coupon code: TTVADNETO20 3. Walk-in purchases (without prior reservations) and offline redemption are not eligible 4. Services are available during operational spa hours, subject to availability of desired time slots at the chosen outlet 5. All prices mentioned are exclusive of taxes. Applicable taxes and service charges will be added at the time of billing. Guests must adhere to standard spa etiquette to ensure a harmonious and enjoyable experience 6. In the event of high demand for redemption near the offer’s expiry date, Tattva may encounter service capacity limitations, which could result in non-redemption 7. This offer is subject to withdrawal or modification based on availability and the terms of the agreement between Tattva Wellness and Adneto 8. This offer is subject to the laws of India, and any dispute arising from or related to this offer shall be exclusively under the jurisdiction of the courts of New Delhi 9. By availing this offer & making the purchase, members are deemed to have accepted all the aforementioned terms and conditions, as well as all terms & conditions stipulated on www.tattvaspa.com and standard spa etiquettes Steps to avail: 1. Click on https://tattvaspa.com/ 2. Copy the coupon code shown on the screen 3. Click on Visit Website to avail the offer on the brand website 4. Make the booking 5. Apply the coupon code at checkout page 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
