ices@benetton.co.in or call on 0124-4590433 between 9AM to 6PM 13. The queries will be responded to within 48hours. Steps to avail: 1. Find the nearest store https://brands.adneto.in/Ucbstorelist 2. Search for the nearest participating United Colors of Benetton store and visit the outlet 3. Select the eligible apparel products 4. Before billing, present your eligible Axis Bank Card to the cashier at the participating store 5. The cashier will verify the card and purchase amount, post which the applicable discount will be applied to the final bill 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
