s.adneto.in/Ucbstorelist 2. Search for the nearest participating United Colors of Benetton store and visit the outlet 3. Select the eligible apparel products 4. Before billing, present your eligible Axis Bank Card to the cashier at the participating store 5. The cashier will verify the card and purchase amount, post which the applicable discount will be applied to the final bill 6. Pay with your Axis Bank Credit or Debit Cards Exclusions: • Offer is not valid on Axis Bank RuPay Credit Card transactions done Via UPI • Offer not valid on Corporate or Commercial Credit cards."}'::jsonb, 'Cash/Discount', '1. Flat 10% discount for Axis Bank Debit/Credit card customers 2. Use Coupon code: Present Your Axis Card 3. Flat 10% discount is valid for the purchase of merchandise (apparel only) at the MRP from Exclusive selected Benetton outlets (mentioned in the table below) Pan India 4. Offer is not valid on Franchise stores 5. Customer can avail the discount multiple times during the offer period 6. In the event of a product purchased using a discount offer being exchanged, the exchange will be facilitated for the value paid by the customer, excluding the discount applied through the discount Code 7. The offer is only applicable at the offline stores not on brand website 8. The issuance and usage of discount offer are at the sole discretion of Benetton India Pvt. Ltd. 9. Benetton & Axis Bank reserves the right to modify, suspend, or terminate the discount offer, or these terms and conditions, at any time without prior notice 10. Benetton reserves the right to cancel the discount offer or refuse to honor transactions that are suspected of being fraudulent or unauthorized. 11. By using discount offer, customers agree to the terms of Benetton''s privacy policy regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal information 12. For any queries or issues regarding the discount offer or purchases made using them, please contact Benetton customer services at c.services@benetton